{
  "era": "wotlk",
  "format": "living-azeroth-npc-summaries",
  "map": 584,
  "npcs": [
    {
      "entry": 24833,
      "name": "Captain \"Stash\" Torgoley",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24833:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:91a6a5887e2e37f439c387d3",
            "source:8eaf1700e6370e870ae25f6b",
            "source:2108026071b71e7ca5a54365",
            "source:6cb3e32b97a639e1f0e2159e",
            "source:4c6ef47d77aedcd2c44bf817"
          ],
          "text": "Captain “Stash” Torgoley commands the Lady Mehley and speaks of enjoying its journeys, even quoting a favorite scribe on how shipboard life can make the wider world seem unnecessary. He asks the crew to bring the ship safely to port and directs First Mate Kowalski during docking.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24833
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Lady Mehley"
    },
    {
      "entry": 24834,
      "name": "Galley Chief Grace",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24834:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:9bbbd60880cc131457415741",
            "source:3b6bd05eef5f97f82fa64dc3",
            "source:a665ca7c8690cfa3333d4b64"
          ],
          "text": "Galley Chief Grace serves aboard the Lady Mehley as its galley chief, offering food and drink provisions to those aboard. Her listed shipboard service is focused on the galley and its everyday needs.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24834
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Lady Mehley"
    },
    {
      "entry": 24835,
      "name": "First Mate Kowalski",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24835:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:8f508ff459b6a283b7e082ca",
            "source:53c6809214ca4431aeabdbc9",
            "source:e8857bea0a9c94cc730f0389",
            "source:485b89c97a3559dcc70231ea",
            "source:93e1bea8b74cb22f4dd8c6d0",
            "source:cbee431f75c70b9834f5cb2b"
          ],
          "text": "First Mate Kowalski keeps his attention on the Lady Mehley and its crew, apologizing when he cannot pause to talk. He coordinates the ship’s arrival with Navigator Mehran and Captain Torgoley, and Sailor Henders reports port in sight to him. His exchanges show a formal, duty-focused manner.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24835
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Lady Mehley"
    },
    {
      "entry": 24836,
      "name": "Abe the Cabin Boy",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24836:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:06b814d952977ee96ea9267d",
            "source:4affded3c1c80bb381c06036",
            "source:2c806d89be5f5b97bbba8f1b"
          ],
          "text": "Abe is the Lady Mehley’s cabin boy, an enthusiastic admirer of both Captain Stash and the ship. He says he swabs the decks and cheerfully claims the work cured his rickets. His remarks show an upbeat pride in the vessel and its everyday chores.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24836
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Lady Mehley"
    },
    {
      "entry": 24837,
      "name": "Navigator Mehran",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24837:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:fc68822d0537d641e0d96218",
            "source:1d84264a14d7a952e81ff758",
            "source:df8819a34ae5573fb69ea5ac",
            "source:e201d7616e47d36bd5169b2c"
          ],
          "text": "Navigator Mehran serves aboard the Lady Mehley and answers First Mate Kowalski with a concise “Aye aye, Mr. Kowalski,” showing a formal working exchange between them. When approached for conversation, Mehran says he has little time to talk, suggesting he is occupied with his duties.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24837
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Lady Mehley"
    },
    {
      "entry": 24838,
      "name": "Sailor Henders",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24838:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:2355ae79e5b645565208f9af",
            "source:661eebe1322ded70c0d5b0d2",
            "source:c5057a39f429f1c312594a2b",
            "source:6973a8c87cc088a30f83333f"
          ],
          "text": "Sailor Henders serves aboard the Lady Mehley and addresses First Mate Kowalski as “Mr. Kowalski” and “sir.” He reports land and port in sight, then thanks Kowalski. In greeting a visitor, he calls it a fine day for sailing in an informal, colloquial voice, giving him a relaxed manner alongside his respectful work reports.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24838
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Lady Mehley"
    },
    {
      "entry": 24839,
      "name": "Sailor Wicks",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24839:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:c26fab9cdc0ff61e10664ace",
            "source:c51d460f3de5bf9f57369664",
            "source:3114d62fa26530b2cbd93506"
          ],
          "text": "Sailor Wicks is a sailor aboard the Lady Mehley. He says Captain Torgoley works the crew hard, but considers him a good captain.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24839
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Lady Mehley"
    },
    {
      "entry": 24840,
      "name": "Sailor Vines",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24840:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:9b049412d8f05a2a009608be",
            "source:a16cb24cc98e9099b5bcbbad",
            "source:f1008336b64b080d8f9641b5"
          ],
          "text": "Sailor Vines works aboard the Lady Mehley and briskly tells visitors that Kowalski may catch them chatting with him on the job.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24840
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Lady Mehley"
    },
    {
      "entry": 24841,
      "name": "Marine Halters",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24841:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:00619be83717ca66c7c044ac",
            "source:315c23ca251956eabf6f0805",
            "source:78aba554fe98bf7dc185f294"
          ],
          "text": "Marine Halters is a marine assigned to guard passengers aboard the Lady Mehley, which he says is often in Theramore.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24841
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 24842,
      "name": "Marine Anderson",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24842:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:f7a51cba1f0ba2733a33ae99",
            "source:beac17bf1607907cf579515d",
            "source:78aba554fe98bf7dc185f294"
          ],
          "text": "Marine Anderson is a marine assigned to guard passengers aboard the Lady Mehley, which he says is often in Theramore.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24842
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 24843,
      "name": "Engineer Combs",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24843:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:4a0ce52bc1e5cb47b659c8e8",
            "source:4a77888378778d821ac87899",
            "source:619af277fa0e3c4eb77b820f",
            "source:c24891d58088ca523b30f902"
          ],
          "text": "Engineer Combs is the Lady Mehley's engineer. He offers goods for sale, including reagents, and can repair equipment.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24843
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Lady Mehley"
    }
  ],
  "place": "Transport: Menethil to Theramore",
